# Ancestor Dragon: "Whenever one or more creatures you control attack, you gain 1 life for each attacking creature." Bot1 casts the
# Dragon (a 5/6 flier) with a Memnite and an Ornithopter on turn 1 and attacks with all three on turn 3: one trigger, for three
# attacking creatures, so Bot1 gains 3 (20 to 23) and the attack deals 5 + 1 + 0 (Bot2 20 to 14). The trigger is on the stack
# before the attackers' damage and gains the life once (CR 603.2c: "one or more" triggers once for the whole declaration).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Ancestor Dragon
Memnite
Ornithopter
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x10

[Actions]
